ath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T14:51:21-08:00","id":423472,"title":"","content":"Just to note, in terms of tech &amp; culture levels of the era, by my reading of the Book of Judges - the era is more or less the exact tail end of the Bronze Age for Judea, with Iron working being picked up via the people beating them with it.... part of me kind of likes the idea of having to buy iron weapons as an Endowment :P The era's &quot;Advanced Armory.&quot;<br /> <br /> Judges 1:19<br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#001320\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">The LORD was with the men of Judah. They took possession of the hill country, but they were unable to drive the people from the plains, because they had chariots fitted with iron.</span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-02-28T15:00:06-08:00","id":423477,"title":"","content":"that sounds awesome! This is a really good way to looking at it, and it really enhance the biblical feeling of the setting.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpat