oll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It seems Hunter is the only gameline not to get an additional Dark Era. This is hardly ideal.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Hopefully we'll get 17th Century Japan. It felt like they reason they were leaving that one undefined was to have a wildcard to balance things out as needed.<br /> <br /> And there is the complete mystery setting of course. I don't believe that backer has come forward.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":1098,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","user":"glamourweaver","date":". 03-01-2015, 05:20 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-03-01T06:17:33-08:00","id":424059,"title":"","content":"We can hope, yes. 17th Century Japan interests me less than the Biblical era, but it's certainly better than nothing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/186-morty","name":"Morty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar186_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"898"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-02T01:02:27-07:00","id":465773,"title":"","content":"...Sothis Ascends (MtC) has a Judge in it.<br /> <br /> The Book of Judges during a Sothic turn is awesome. I do hope that our beloved Devs will find it in th